---

<BaseLayout title="全平台代理客户端教程：Clash、Shadowrocket与v2rayN配置指南 - 机场猫" description="机场猫为您提供Windows、macOS、iOS与Android四大平台的代理客户端图文配置教程。包含软件下载、订阅导入及核心功能讲解，助您快速连接专线节点。">
  <main class="w-full relative z-10 flex flex-col bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 min-h-screen pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 w-full">
      
      <!-- H1 Header -->
      <header class="mb-12 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
              代理客户端下载与配置指南
            </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">选择您的操作系统，获取最新版主流代理客户端及详细配置教程。</p>
      </header>

<!-- The 6 Navigation Cards (H1 frameworks) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        
        <!-- Left Side: 6 Navigation Cards (Shrunk) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 h-full">
            <a href="#windows" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">💻</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">Windows 代理软件</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">电脑主力常驻</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#android" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🤖</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">安卓代理软件</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">免费开源选择更多</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#ios" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">📱</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">iOS 代理软件</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">免费与买断应用</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#macos" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-slate-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🍎</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">macOS 代理软件</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">菜单栏和原生体验</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#tools" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">🛠️</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">订阅格式不兼容</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">再看转换工具</p>
              </div>
            </a>
            
            <a href="#changelog" class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-rose-500/50 transition-all text-left flex items-center gap-4 h-full">
              <div class="text-3xl group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">⚠️</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-base mb-0.5">怕用到停更项目</div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">先看维护状态</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Right Side: Tips Box -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
